  "title": "Accessibility Feature Binary Replacement",
  "description": "Detects replacement of or debugger hijack on accessibility binaries (sethc.exe, utilman.exe, osk.exe, magnify.exe, narrator.exe, displayswitch.exe), enabling a pre-logon SYSTEM shell from the lock screen.",
